40674314962", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_1472940677648295_793008856734645269_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Wzoemre2Qe4Q7kNvwG8_DOo&_nc_oc=AdrmEhjRtUd551tZo93DHtGRBmA_5KaUT9NRTv2xL4WSXff7UKLRB6Tq1Albevnb5Z8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTf_7SkFR25YSHTIejda5E-HqskSRurIYyxb91ToSkhQw&oe=6AF5C6E6"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Galactic Fury - VR Space War", "keywords": ["SpaceWar", "SpaceGames", "GalaxyWar", "SpaceShip"], "long_description": "Galactic Fury is an exciting space action game where players travel across the galaxy and fight dangerous enemies in huge space battles. The game takes place in the future, where powerful armies are trying to control planets, space stations, and important resources. Players become brave space commanders who must protect their team, defeat enemy fleets, and bring peace to the galaxy.\n \nIn Galactic Fury, players can fly advanced spaceships equipped with lasers, missiles, shields, and powerful weapons. Each spaceship has different abilities, speed, and strength. Some ships are fast and perfect for quick attacks, while others are large battleships with heavy armor and massive firepower. Players can upgrade their ships by unlocking stronger engines, better weapons, and special technology during the game.\n \nThe game includes many exciting missions and adventures. Players explore unknown planets, asteroid fields, and mysterious areas filled with hidden treasures and enemy bases. Some missions require destroying enemy fleets, while others focus on rescuing allies, collecting resources, or defending important locations from attacks. Every mission offers new challenges and keeps the gameplay interesting.\n \nOne of the best parts of Galactic Fury is the large space battles. Players fight against enemy commanders in action-packed combat filled with explosions, laser beams, and fast-moving starfighters.", "short_description": "Galactic Fury is an intense space warfare game where players command powerful starfighters and massive battle fleets across a war-torn galaxy. Fight through explosive missions, conquer enemy sectors, and engage in fast-paced combat against rival factions determined to dominate the universe. Upgrade advanced weapons, customize ships, and master tactical battles in deep space environments filled with danger and mystery."}]}, "developer_name": "Abstron Pvt Ltd", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-games-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "36770158695916557"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622919_1458426232228169_7106961010878553943_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1LkWiqOFRr4Q7kNvwHRau5X&_nc_oc=Adr_-5sKsplwR5T3fEjaLP4yHCe6a0GdR8dAAj2g4TQm0OoGazjjEdZxI0BXvZToxNo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSvaq2FVrCdZNtexvoRiUdWR16ZcUd-nHus96Pb_736Zg&oe=6AF5D730"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Galacti